rved:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但是，魚兒們洄游時，本來暢行無阻的水道，現在有了","n":24,"ssz":"....1..................."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇課文是一篇說明文，介紹魚兒洄游時被閘門擋住，以及人們如何解決這個問題。文章從第四段開始有明顯的「問題、解決、結果」結構。但閱讀時，如何找到文章中的問題、解決、結果呢？我們可以根據內容線索來做判斷喔！\n我們來練習用兩步驟找「問題、解決、結果」。\n❶找段落 ❷找重點句","n":134,"ssz":"..............1..................1.................................................................1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇課文是一篇說明文，介紹魚兒洄游時被閘門擋住，以及人們如何解決這個問題。文章從第四段開始有明顯的「問題、解決、結果」結構。但閱讀時，如何找到文章中的問題、解決、結果呢？我們可以根據內容線索來做判斷喔！","n":101,"ssz":"..............1..................1.................................................................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們來練習用兩步驟找「問題、解決、結果」。","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶找段落 ❷找重點句","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、找「問題」","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].tip","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"※祕訣：「問題」是需要解決的困難或不好的情況。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶找段落：「問題」在哪個段落？（請在□打勾，單選）","n":25,"ssz":"...........1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段1、2、3","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段4","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段5","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段落判斷的說明框","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「問題」通常出現文章的前面，不過，這篇文章的前面三段先說明背景，到了第四段才寫出魚兒遭遇的困難。","n":48,"ssz":"..............1..........................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷找重點句：本文第四段有三個句子，都和魚兒遇到的問題有關。哪一句最能說出魚兒面臨的主要困難？(3選1)","n":51,"ssz":".............1.1..1.1.........1......1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句1：但是，魚兒們洄游時，本來暢行無阻的水道，現在有了一重重的閘門擋住了去路，製造了多重危機。","n":47,"ssz":".......1...................1...............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句2：當萬頭鑽動的魚兒滯留在閘門附近的水域時，就會面臨食物不足、水質變差及容易被天敵（例如鳥類）捕食的風險，這可能會使魚兒錯過繁殖契機，導致魚寶寶的數量減少，影響整個魚群的生存。","n":89,"ssz":"..........1.................................................1...........1.........1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[2].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句3：為了保護魚兒，閘門管理員只能經常到河邊檢查是否有魚群，或定時開啟閘門，既辛苦又無法準確掌握時機。","n":51,"ssz":"...1....1.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小撇步","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小撇步：\n這段有3個句子，第一句直接說出魚兒被閘門擋住，面臨多重危機，是「問題」的重點句；第二句是補充危機造成的後果；第三句說明以前的處理方法，以及這個方法遇到的問題。","n":84,"ssz":"...........1.........1.........1...........................................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小撇步：","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這段有3個句子，第一句直接說出魚兒被閘門擋住，面臨多重危機，是「問題」的重點句；第二句是補充危機造成的後果；第三句說明以前的處理方法，以及這個方法遇到的問題。","n":79,"ssz":"......1.........1.........1...........................................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、找「解決」","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].tip","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"※祕訣：「解決」說明誰想出辦法或採取行動，通常出現在文章中段。","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶找段落：（請在□打勾，單選）「解決」在哪個段落？","n":25,"ssz":".....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段6","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷找重點句：（第5段）第5段的四個句子都在說明解決方法。哪一句是「解決」的重點？(4選1)","n":45,"ssz":"................1.1..........1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句1：為了解決這個問題，生態學家馬克．范赫斯和一群工程師、科學家合作，在荷蘭烏特勒支市的運河設計了「魚門鈴」。","n":55,"ssz":"...11...1.............1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句2：他們在運河裡裝設了水下攝影機，當魚兒游到閘門附近時，攝影機會捕捉到牠們的蹤影，並把影像傳送到一個網站。","n":54,"ssz":"....................1.............................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句3：這個網站就像「魚兒直播間」，全世界的人都可以上網觀看！如果有人發現閘門前有魚群聚集，代表魚兒塞車了，就可以點擊網站上的「魚門鈴」按鈕。","n":70,"ssz":"....1......1....................................1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句4：運河管理員收到訊息後，便會開啟閘門，讓魚兒順利通過。","n":29,"ssz":".......................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小撇步：\n這段有4個句子。第一句直接說出生態學家和團隊設計了「魚門鈴」，是「解決」的重點句。第二～四句是補充說明「魚門鈴」如何運作。","n":66,"ssz":"...........1............1........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這段有4個句子。第一句直接說出生態學家和團隊設計了「魚門鈴」，是「解決」的重點句。第二～四句是補充說明「魚門鈴」如何運作。","n":61,"ssz":"......1............1........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、找「結果」","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].tip","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"※祕訣：「結果」常接在「解決」之後，說明行動後，帶來了什麼改變，通常出現在文章的後段。","n":43,"ssz":"..........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶找段落：（請在□打勾，單選）「結果」在哪個段落？","n":25,"ssz":".....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段7","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷找重點句：（第6段）哪一句是「結果」的重點句，清楚寫出「魚門鈴」帶來的改變？(2選1)","n":44,"ssz":"............1..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句1：「魚門鈴」上線後，效果超乎預期！","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句2：自2019年啟動以來，「魚門鈴」已幫助無數魚兒順利通過運河閘門，運河的生態系統也因此變得更健康。","n":51,"ssz":".........................1....................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小撇步：\n這段2個句子。第二句清楚寫出兩項成果：魚兒順利通過閘門，運河生態也變得更健康。因此，第二句是「結果」的重點句。","n":60,"ssz":"..........1..............1.............1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[